sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as React Dispatcher
    participant D as Delivery API
    participant DB as Delivery DB
    participant C as Flutter Courier
    participant O as Private object storage
    UI->>D: ListParcels status=Created and CourierWorkload
    D-->>UI: Authorized queue and capacity
    UI->>D: POST /api/v1/deliveries/assign (AssignCourier)
    D->>DB: Atomic expectedVersion, capacity and current-assignment checks
    alt Stale/capacity/role rejected
        D-->>UI: 409 / 422 / 403, no change
    else Assigned
        D->>DB: Commit assignment, version, history, StatusChanged outbox
        D-->>UI: 200 Assigned and version
        C->>D: CourierAssignments, guarded status updates
        D-->>C: Current assigned parcel
        Note over C,D: Assigned → PickedUp → InTransit → OutForDelivery
        C->>D: POST /api/v1/deliveries/{id}/pod (CompleteDeliveryWithProof)
        D->>O: Validate and store private proof
        alt Storage failed
            D-->>C: 503, status unchanged
        else Stored
            D->>DB: Commit Delivered only if assignment/version still match
            alt Concurrent reassignment/status conflict
                D-->>C: 409 / 404, orphan cleaned after 24h
            else Success
                D-->>C: 200 Delivered, relay notifies asynchronously
            end
        end
    end
